{"title":"Classic Airlines Apparel","link":"https://kottke.org/25/09/classic-airlines-apparel","date":1758119836000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/08left-shirts.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/08left-shirts.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/08left-shirts.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"730\" alt=\"two tshirts, one with BRANIFF repeated three times and the other with PIONEER AIR LINES in a circle around a buffalo\" /></p>\n\n<p>Remember <a href=\"https://reaganray.com/2019/05/20/airline-logos.html\">the collection of classic airline logos</a> I <a href=\"https://kottke.org/19/05/classic-airline-logos\">linked to</a> a few years ago? The folks at 08 Left have taken some of those old logos and <a href=\"https://08left.com/collections/apparel/vintage\">put them on hats, t-shirts, and hoodies</a>.</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/design\">design</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/fashion\">fashion</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/flying\">flying</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/09/classic-airlines-apparel\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"7db478ab03ffa170918baaa07379809933d25813c2a6d5d0b48464973fa61b3d","category":"Sites"}